cff-version: 1.2.0
title: forrt-research-mcp
message: >-
  If you use forrt-research-mcp, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fouilloux
    given-names: Anne
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1784-2920
    affiliation: LifeWatch ERIC
repository-code: https://github.com/ScienceLiveHub/forrt-research-mcp
url: https://sciencelive4all.org
abstract: >-
  An MCP server for producing verifiable FORRT nanopublication chains. It gives
  AI agents the tools a researcher needs while doing the work: grounded quote
  verification against the source paper, compact projections of Science Live
  constellations, and validation of chain drafts and published chains. It serves
  reproductions, replications and new research on the same rails.
keywords:
  - FORRT
  - nanopublications
  - replication
  - reproducibility
  - open science
  - MCP
  - Science Live
license: MIT
